  "answer_text": "Throughout December 8, 2025, the arrivals at the main entrance were as follows: \n\n- 00:00 - 01:00: 13\n- 01:00 - 02:00: 18\n- 02:00 - 03:00: 8\n- 03:00 - 04:00: 12\n- 04:00 - 05:00: 8\n- 05:00 - 06:00: 15\n- 06:00 - 07:00: 10\n- 07:00 - 08:00: 7\n- 08:00 - 09:00: 311\n- 09:00 - 10:00: 334\n- 10:00 - 11:00: 9\n- 11:00 - 12:00: 12\n- 12:00 - 13:00: 154\n- 13:00 - 14:00: 14\n- 14:00 - 15:00: 8\n- 15:00 - 16:00: 13\n- 16:00 - 17:00: 12\n- 17:00 - 18:00: 268\n- 18:00 - 19:00: 255\n- 19:00 - 20:00: 14\n- 20:00 - 21:00: 12\n- 21:00 - 22:00: 11\n- 22:00 - 23:00: 7\n- 23:00 - 00:00: 6\n\nThe peak hours were 09:00 with 334 arrivals and 08:00 with 311 arrivals.",
